        "activity": "Show two contrasting art pieces (bright vs dark, busy vs simple). Model preferences with clear gestures: 'J'aime!' (thumbs up, smile) and 'J'aime pas!' (gentle shake of head). Students practice with hand gestures for each phrase.",
