          "Si les gestes sont trop excités → modéliser des mouvements plus calmes et inviter à copier"
        ],
        "movementBreaks": [
          "Natural movement opportunities during activity"
        ]
      },
      "main": {
        "duration": "~27 min",
        "activity": "Artistic Journey Celebration: Students create final celebration piece showing their artistic growth. Choose favorite technique learned and create 'masterpiece' while reflecting: 'Au début j'étais..., maintenant je suis...' Prepare portfolio presentations for families. Practice sharing artistic vocabulary and growth stories in French.",
        "materials": [
          "Portfolio folders organized with chronological artwork",
          "Full art supplies access for celebration piece creation",
          "Presentation space setup with display areas",
          "Family invitation preparations if doing presentation",
